# Loamcrafter Faun: Bot1 holds two Islands and discards only one. "That many" is the one discarded, not the land cards
# held (CR 603.12): with Black Lotus and Lotus Petal both in the graveyard, the answer returning both is refused, and
# Lotus Petal alone comes back. The other Island stays in hand.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Lotus Petal
Black Lotus
Lightning Bolt
Loamcrafter Faun
Island
Island
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Lotus Petal.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Battlefield.Lotus Petal.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Loamcrafter Faun.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Island)
! Bot1.Target(Black Lotus; Lotus Petal)
Bot1.Target(Lotus Petal)

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand = Island; Lotus Petal
Bot1.Graveyard = Island; Lightning Bolt; Black Lotus
